Package: UnitTrans
Type: Package
Title: Distributions on the Unit Interval via Transformations of
        Baseline Laws
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Mohamad Yamen", "Al-Mohamad", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "yamenmohamad@tabrizu.ac.ir",
    comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0009-1665-7203")),
    person("Ali Akbar", "Hydari", role = "aut",
    email = "heydari@tabrizu.ac.ir"))
Description: Builds new probability distributions on (0,1) by applying a
    monotone transformation (rational, exponential, logit, 'tanh', probit,
    complementary log-log) to a baseline random variable Y with any
    available d/p/q/r functions. Provides density, distribution, quantile and
    random generation functions, maximum likelihood fitting with information
    criteria, profile-likelihood and bootstrap confidence intervals, automatic
    model search over baseline/transformation pairs, goodness-of-fit tests with
    parametric bootstrap, moments, hazard and simulation studies.
